  ␛[0;2;3m[image: Enlarged icon]␛[0m

  A percentage is of the text width; the text
  width still bounds the image:

  ␛[0;2;3m[image: Quarter width]␛[0m

  ␛[0;2;3m[image: Too wide]␛[0m

  A linked image is shown, but cannot be
